    # From the Theban Tribunal Timeline (Atlas Games web supplement, by Chris Jensen-Romer): the Tribunal's meetings, and the Byzantine Emperors by dynasty.

    #t882a5a17f364d1445fbfbb ^"Theban Tribunal meetings" DEF {
