            ^"Table Columns" LIST ["Year"]
            ^"Table Columns Source" STRING "editorial: the book prints no column heads for this table"
            ^"Printed" STRING "Theban Tribunal meetings of the Order of Hermes were held in 871, 878, 885, 892, 899, 906, 913, 920, 927, 934, 941, 948, 955, 962, 969, 976, 983, 990, 996, 1004, 1011, 1018, 1025, 1032, 1039, 1046, 1054, 1061, 1067, 1074, 1080, 1087, 1094 1101, 1108, 1115, 1122, 1129, 1137, 1144, 1151, 1158, 1165, 1172, 1179, 1186, 1193, 1200, 1207, 1214."
            ^"From" STRING "Theban Tribunal Timeline (Atlas Games web supplement, by Chris Jensen-Romer)"
            ^"Source" STRING "The Sundered Eagle"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 1
        }
